        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Find three passages from your own reading in which writers vary the lengths of their sentences. What is the effect of this variation on the rhythm and meaning of the passages? Rewrite the passages so that their sentences are consistently fifteen to twenty-five words long. What is the effect of this change?",
